							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">1. Vis Maior&nbsp; (Entrenched in Aguish)<br />2. Dol Amroth/Echoes in Eternity&nbsp; (Anguish)<br />3-4. Wraith/Reviviscence, Cold Fury (Various stages in GoD)<br />5. Conviction (Coming out of Time, various stages of GoD)<br />6. Moonlight Crusaders (Time Farming)<br />7.Dawning Nemesis&nbsp; (Time Farming)<br />8.&nbsp; Inner Loop (missing Coirnav)<br />9. Union of Power (missing Rathe Council)<br />10. Underguild (FR and Xegony killed)<br />11. Radiant (FR kill, Poe B)<br />12.&nbsp; Outcast Adventurers (Fennin Ro killed)<br />13.&nbsp; Brew Masters (Killed Sol Ro, about to start raiding elementals)<br />14.&nbsp; Vinceremo (Missing Sol Ro)<br />15.&nbsp; League of Sozobon (kill Agnar and Bert)<br /><br />With many that are in DN that have had experience clearing time, I think they are a solid 7th spot.They have alot of very active members and are aggressivly tackling content.they deserve a move up on the list.<br /><br />Sinef</td>
