							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">All I can say is there were so many VERY fine people in the &quot;old&quot; conviction.Llew, Disso, Vosh, Ysaabeau and about half the guild who are carring your flag now.I did a who all conv the other night, and there were a TON of peeps in there that were either flagged by many of the old conviction or were old conviction..This Old conviction bashing is getting way out of hand.I know I gave that guild a ton of my time as did all the old officers, and to sit here a give them grief .. MAN...<br /><br />As far as buying a new server .. It is your guild .. you SHOULD buy what you need to operate.<br /><br />Rylden.. I was an officer of conviction who left... And you bet your comments towards me are just way unfounded.<br /><br />&quot;I&#039;m so glad you left... each and every one of you... because we&#039;d still be stuck in PoP content kissing your asses just because you thought you were better somehow cause you had an O or L next to your name.&quot;<br /><br />I am just in awe..I guess the first thing that comes to mind is the night all of us old timers stayed up the entire night to get thru the 6 man ikkins trial to help the guild progress in new raid areas... We accomplished it BEFORE anyone was time flagged and Before they &#039;returned&quot; it making it much easier.To this day I dont think anyone on any server actually broke all 3 trials before they had time gear on or were post level 65.And all I could remember in the morning after getting it accomplished is man we got the &quot;guild&quot; thru those trials so we can raid high level pop content.. gosh .. I am in awe rylden..Conviction was well into pop progression not long after the release of the expansion.<br /><br />I honestly cant believe I am reading all this junk .<br /></td>
