						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Wow, <br /><br />    After reading alot of this thread, I really don&#039;t know how to respond to this other than maybe give some peeps a heads up on a few things. First of all Ferniss is nothing but a class act, and I highly doubt he would ever try and steal a recruit from conviction.I am sure both guilds have gotten inquiries from many of the same peeps wanting to join them, and I am sure both have put their best foot foward to get them to join.. but Ferniss actually taking their emails and soliciting  the potiential apps .. I doubt that has happened.Ferniss is nothing but a jam up individual who is out to have a great time in eq ....he is definatly a slacker , but I would discount anything that was said about his character as a person.I know my time in eq has been blessed by knowing him.<br /><br />     As for kinadorm (prodigy) he was a big part of the old conviction. He participated in almost every big kill I can ever remember.He spent countless hours getting peeps thru tipt and vxed as well as helped a ton of us on our bic stuff.The guy really put his heart in the &quot;old&quot; conviction, and I tip my hat to him.It was guys like him who really put his heart into a guild, and he earned every bit of his gear on the toon &quot;kinadorm&quot;. I know when Ratagar left, kinadorm really stepped in to fill his shoes./cheer kina ... I am glad to see you playing again, and I hope you guys the best of luck.I know DN will be time flagged soon.<br /><br />     As for Justyse, I think it really is meaningless on when she actually joined. She too put her heart into conviction and helped so many times I cant remember. Dragging peeps, organizing rogues, and taking to heart the day to day activities of conviction, were all in her daily planner.She was very loyal, and gave conviction all she could. I am really glad to see you guys doing so well, and I hope to see you guys win countless more kills!BTW guys ...I am not sure about if justyse looks exactly like her signature .... but she does have a sexy voice! <br /><br />     I sure am sorry to see so much bad blood from the old conviction peeps.We did alot together back then, and I am sure we will all achieve much more in our own &quot;new&quot; tags.<br /><br />     Oh and btw .. I could have sworn there were a few more old school people in conviction.Hayniss, Strumph, Shyran, lach, Jeddah are all around aren&#039;t they?I know I have forgotten a few, but they all were part of the gang that got us thru the Raithe Council.I dont think jeddah was around for some of our first Xegony kills but still he was a big part of some of our raiding back then.And for all the new guys in conviction, You all have done great!I am really glad to see you move foward in game.You have a great guild tag. Wear it proudly!!!</td>
